Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:05.32,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:07.41,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,If you're gonna switch, just do it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:13.13,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter, brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:37.43,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The Innate Domain's closed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.43,0:00:38.88,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The special-grade is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:43.33,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Now we just need Itadori to return safely...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:50.64,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but he's not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.23,0:00:53.86,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be so frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:56.05,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a great mood right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:00:57.36,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Let's chat for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:04.60,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,This is what he gets for trying to \Nuse me without any kind of pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:07.56,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Feels like he's having some \Ntrouble switching back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:10.72,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Still, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:12.57,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:17.35,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:20.67,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I thought about what I can do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:30.81,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:40.35,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I'm taking this brat hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.35,0:01:41.58,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Hostage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.58,0:01:42.32,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:45.04,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I can live without this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:46.80,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,but that ain't true for the brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:50.98,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Switching out with me means he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:53.24,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:56.08,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,For good measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:00.67,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Sukuna's finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.09,0:02:04.09,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That special-grade cursed spirit \Nin there must have consumed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.49,0:02:09.33,Main,sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,With that, I'm free as a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:11.06,Main,sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,You can be frightened now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.27,Main,sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:14.72,Main,sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,For no particular reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:20.34,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Our positions are reversed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:40.00,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(1191,431)\t(1192,1316,1 \c&H0700D7&\3c&H6659E4&)\t(1317,1941,1 \c&H172918&\3c&H8CCECB&)\t(6197,6529,1 \c&H0F0063&\3c&H222781&)}Jujutsu Kaisen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:04:00.55,Ep_Title_Shadow,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(529,519)\an1\pos(30,305)\fs20}Episode 5:  {\fs24}Curse Womb Must Die -II-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:04:00.55,Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(529,519)\an1\pos(30,305)\fs20}Episode 5:  {\fs24}Curse Womb Must Die -II-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:04:01.52,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}The only thing granted equally \Nto all is an unfair reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:16.09,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,You just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:17.49,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:19.81,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:22.48,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Even if that means he'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:24.44,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That's just who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:26.45,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,You give him too much credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:30.55,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,This guy's just a little tougher \Nand denser than other humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.51,0:04:36.17,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Just a moment ago, he was scared out \Nof his mind, on the verge of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:39.84,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,and prattling on about his \Nregrets and all that nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:44.59,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I know for a fact he doesn't \Nhave the guts to kill himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.77,0:04:47.51,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,His arm is restored!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:55.77,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Healing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:57.95,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,He can use Reverse Cursed Techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:00.91,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Sukuna's incarnated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:04.41,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Even if he can live without a heart, \Nit should still be damaging to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:08.73,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make him heal his heart \Nbefore Itadori returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:12.27,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I just have to make him believe he can't \Nbeat me without a heart in his body!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:15.92,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Can I do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.52,0:05:20.67,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,when I couldn't even move with \Nthat special-grade in front of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:26.85,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's not about whether I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:28.76,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I have to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:36.41,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I'm finally outside, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:38.06,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Let's use the open space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.72,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.55,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,You use Shikigami,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:52.12,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,but you'll still come at me yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:00.47,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,More.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:02.72,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,More.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:06.34,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,More!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:11.03,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Put more curse behind it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:14.18,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,when you strike me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:19.06,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:26.20,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Gang up on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.84,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:43.65,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Let's use the open space!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:10.33,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's not even a matter of jujutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.84,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,His power
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:13.33,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,and his agility
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:14.55,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,are on a different scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:16.21,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Nice technique there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.36,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:33.99,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I used up one of my shikigami \Nto escape that Innate Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:38.32,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Demon Dog White and \NOrochi are both destroyed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.36,0:07:41.88,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,And Nue's at his limit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:46.03,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I should release him \Nbefore he gets destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:51.12,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:55.18,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,So your shikigami are created from shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:07:58.37,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It makes no difference if he knows that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.09,0:08:00.19,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:01.68,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:05.04,Italics,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,It's not the generic technique \Nthat uses charms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:06.84,Italics,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,It's adaptable, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:08.98,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:12.97,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you run back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:18.23,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,What a waste of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:20.69,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.42,0:08:24.83,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Either way, that won't be enough to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:26.39,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,He's figured it out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:29.39,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,You're risking your life over stupid shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:32.53,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,This brat isn't even worth that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:37.99,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Then why did you bother saving me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:46.48,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The only thing granted equally \Nto all is an unfair reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:51.92,Flashback,Tsumiki,0000,0000,0000,,If I have the time to curse someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:54.42,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather spend it thinking \Nabout those precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:58.64,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,There was no room to doubt \Nwhat a good person she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.85,0:09:03.74,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,She deserved happiness \Nmore than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:06.91,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,But Tsumiki was still cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:14.68,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,The father who named me "Megumi"\Nwith no regard for my gender
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:17.84,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,is still off living as he pleases somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:25.16,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Karma isn't fully automatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.91,0:09:30.13,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Evil people can only be judged under the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:36.67,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Jujutsu sorcerers are just another \Ncog in that machine of retribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:46.42,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I want more good people to \Nenjoy fairness, even if only a few,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:51.65,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,so I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:55.53,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,save people unequally!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:00.91,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:02.70,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:07.43,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,So this is when you start \Nburning through your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:09.10,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:12.04,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:15.77,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Show me, Fushiguro Megumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:23.43,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Sacred treasure swing \Nand ring, ring -Eight Grip-!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.57,0:10:31.39,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Just so you know, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:37.49,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,don't have any logical reason \Nfor saving you back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:42.39,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it was dangerous, I couldn't bear \Nto see a good person like you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:45.70,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I did have my reservations,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:48.58,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,but ultimately, it was for \Nselfish, emotional reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:52.03,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That's fine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.05,0:10:54.72,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:58.56,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a jujutsu sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.92,0:11:04.72,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,So I've never once regretted saving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:11.69,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:14.93,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You really are smart, Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:17.20,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You've put more thought into this than I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:19.99,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I think your conviction's a proper one,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:22.66,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,but I don't think mine is wrong, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:29.84,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry, I'm almost done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.84,0:11:35.47,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Guess I won't have to worry about you, \NKugisaki, or Gojou-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:39.76,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Live a long life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.61,0:12:06.95,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}Jujutsu Kaisen
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:11.96,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}Jujutsu Kaisen
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.17,0:12:30.33,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Well, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:35.98,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Was there any real reason \Nto use a precious finger
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:37.79,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,to test Sukuna's strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:42.28,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,Well, there wasn't much point to it \Nwith a half-baked test case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:45.13,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,But we did learn a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:47.94,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph. I'll be praying that's not just an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:54.63,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Stop talking! No one \Nunderstands what you're saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:13:01.75,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,We don't understand, yet the meaning \Nflows right into our minds. It's creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:06.38,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs16\frx12\fry54\c&H76D7F2&\3c&HFDFDFF&\shad0\b1\pos(318,209.333)\frz344}Café Restaurant\N{\fnArial\fs20\c&H55B274&\3c&HFCFFF9&\xshad-2\4c&HC4CCC7&}Rice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:08.72,Main,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:11.54,Main,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like a seat for one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:14.97,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, one, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.67,0:13:30.61,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you encounter it, your choices \Nare to either run or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:35.60,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,I warned them that fighting \Nwas absolutely not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:38.77,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,It was intentional.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:41.11,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:43.26,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,There was a special-grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:46.31,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Sending first-years to rescue \Nfive who may or may not be alive
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:48.31,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,should be out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:51.00,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, with Yuuji,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:55.54,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I was the one who forced the issue and \Ngot his execution indefinitely suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:57.44,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Some higher-ups who didn't like that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:59.84,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,took advantage of my absence \Nand the special-grade
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:03.53,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,to tactfully dispose of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:08.21,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,If the other two had also died, \Nit'd be more harassment for me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:10.65,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,and two birds with one stone for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:12.55,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:17.03,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,No one expected it to become a special-grade \Nby the time the dispatch was issued.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.51,0:14:19.67,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Searching for someone to blame is just a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:23.28,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I should just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:26.80,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,kill all of the higher-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:32.52,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,You're not usually this emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:35.28,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's good to see you, Ieiri-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:37.45,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,Looks to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.45,0:14:39.91,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,like you've taken quite a liking to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:44.35,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I've always been a nice guy \Nwho cares for my students.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:47.36,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't torment Ijichi too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:50.73,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,He's got it rough, stuck  \Nbetween us and the higher-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:54.76,Italics,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,Keep going! Keep going! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:54.21,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I don't care about a man's hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:55.12,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.71,0:14:57.97,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,So this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:02.21,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,Sukuna's vessel, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.90,0:15:05.89,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,I can take him apart as I please, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.64,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure to get good use out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:09.98,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:12.37,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:19.51,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,"Live a long life"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:23.30,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't mean much when \Nyou go and die yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:26.97,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Is this your first time having a partner die?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.83,0:15:29.43,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,First time for one my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:33.99,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,You seem to be taking it well, considering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:35.52,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:36.82,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.19,0:15:39.27,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I only knew him for about two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:45.35,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not some simple woman who breaks down \Nbawling when a guy I barely know dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:48.89,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:01.45,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's hot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:07.34,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Wonder if it's time for summer uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.09,0:16:17.40,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.60,0:16:22.04,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,You're looking more glum than usual, Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:23.48,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,This a wake or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:26.27,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Zenin-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:28.30,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me by my last name!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:29.50,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Maki! Maki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:30.90,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm talking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.90,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You actually don't know why they're so down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.90,0:16:35.27,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:37.50,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Someone really did die yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.86,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,One of the first-year boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:40.77,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Bonito flakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.87,0:16:43.79,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,You should've told me sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:47.04,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Now I look like some heartless, \Ncold-blooded demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:48.51,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,That's exactly how you came off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:49.56,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Tuna and mayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:52.21,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}You're supposed to try\N to make me feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:52.91,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Who are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:54.80,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Our second-year upperclassmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:58.53,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You have to be kinder to your underclassmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:17:01.42,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,There's more to kindness \Nthan being soft on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:05.42,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Zenin-senpai is the best of all the \Nstudents at wielding cursed tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:06.64,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Salmon roe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:09.15,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,That's the Cursed Speech \Nuser, Inumaki-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:11.44,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,He can only speak in \Ningredients of rice balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:15.39,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,He's a bit softer when Yuuta's around, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:16.43,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Panda-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.24,0:17:23.23,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,There's one more, Okkotsu-senpai, \Nwho's the only one I can openly respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:26.22,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,but he's overseas right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:28.94,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,You're not adding more \Nabout the panda named Panda?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:32.23,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Man, sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:34.20,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,And when you're in mourning...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:36.21,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Please forgive us for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:41.77,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,The truth is, we'd like you to participate \Nin the Kyoto Sister School Exchange Event.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:45.12,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Kyoto Sister School Exchange Event?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.18,0:17:47.35,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:50.68,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,It's a get-together with the \Nother Tech school in Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.77,0:17:54.58,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Though isn't that event \Nmainly second- and third-years?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:58.40,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,And those stupid third-years \Nare suspended right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:17:59.96,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,So you need to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:03.14,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,What do you do at this event?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:04.35,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Smash Bros.{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:06.12,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I won't lose if it's the Wii version.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:08.33,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll Meteor Smash so you can't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:10.33,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's make a 3-man team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:15.06,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,The exchange event has the principals \Nof the Tokyo and Kyoto schools
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.37,0:18:21.59,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,each propose a form of competition to be held \Nfor an entire day over the course of two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:24.08,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Though that's just how it is on paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:28.96,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Every year, the first day is team battles, \Nand the second day is individual battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:29.88,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.78,0:18:33.12,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Individual and team battles?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:36.80,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,We fight?! Against other jujutsu sorcerers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:41.59,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's a jujutsu battle \Nwhere anything but killing goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:46.03,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,We'll train you up well \Nso you won't get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.03,0:18:47.95,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.18,0:18:51.47,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, do you have time for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.47,0:18:53.93,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I thought we were short\Non jujutsu sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:57.45,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,That's a good question. For now, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:06.16,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\move(284,120,-10,-234)\fay.14\c&H585D5C&\3c&H747978&\shad0\frx356\fry14\t(28,110,1 \3c&HE8EDEC&)}Winter Blues
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:06.16,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fay.14\c&H0A0A0A&\3c&H0A0A0A&\shad0\frx356\fs18\fry14\t(1821,1945,1 \c&H8C8F8E&\3c&HE8EDEC&)\move(436,226,132,-137)}Disrupt Autonomic Nerves
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:06.16,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fay.14\c&H0A0A0A&\3c&H0A0A0A&\shad0\frx356\fs18\fry14\t(4115,4239,1 \c&H8C8F8E&\3c&HE8EDEC&)\move(580,314,255,-10)}Change in Environment
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:06.16,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fay.14\c&H0A0A0A&\3c&H0A0A0A&\shad0\frx356\fs18\fry14\t(6325,6450,1 \c&H8C8F8E&\3c&HE8EDEC&)\move(665,410,380,95)}May Blues
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:19:01.41,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,The glum emotions people harbor \Nfrom late winter through spring
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:05.70,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,cause an outburst of curses in the \Nearly summer, so that's our busy season.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.69,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes we're busy all year long,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.69,0:19:10.96,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,but things should be settling down soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:12.00,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:13.92,Main,maki,0000,0000,0000,,So, you'll do it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:16.13,Main,maki,0000,0000,0000,,You just had a partner \Ndie on you, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.40,0:19:17.31,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,We're in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:18.59,Italics,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.83,0:19:19.79,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:22.32,Italics,Both,0000,0000,0000,,...have to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.31,Italics,Both,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do anything to achieve that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:29.66,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,But if I decide this training and exchange \Nevent is pointless, I'm quitting instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.92,0:19:30.90,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.09,0:19:35.76,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Well, people this cocky are \Nall the more worthwhile to train.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:36.84,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Bonito flakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:41.61,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs20\c&H76D7F2&\3c&HFDFDFF&\shad0\b1\frz11.99\move(510,255,510,125)\frx18\fax-.1\fry346}Café Restaurant\N{\fnArial\fs24\c&H55B274&\3c&HFCFFF9&\xshad2\yshad1\4c&HC4CCC7&}Rice
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:41.61,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,So you're saying your boss
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:45.61,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,wants to reverse the current \Npositions of humans and curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:47.67,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:49.96,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Well, roughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:52.22,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,It's slightly different, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:55.39,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Humans are made up of lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.39,0:19:59.87,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,For every positive action and emotion \Nthey show, there's always a flip-side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:07.53,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Yet negative emotions like hatred and \Nhostility are truths without falsehood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:11.57,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Since we curses are born \Nfrom those emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:14.77,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,that makes us true, pure beings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:17.19,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Imitations should be eliminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:21.33,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,Yet, at present, you're \Nthe ones being eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:24.10,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,That's why we've come to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.10,0:20:27.00,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,What can we do to defeat \Nthe jujutsu sorcerers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:29.02,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,If you fulfill two conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.65,0:20:32.16,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,before going to war, then you can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.30,0:20:34.67,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,And what are these two conditions?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:39.18,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,The first involves the man known \Nas the strongest jujutsu sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.52,0:20:42.63,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,You have to render \NGojou Satoru incapable of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.47,0:20:49.18,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,The second is to get Ryoumen Sukuna \Nand Itadori Yuuji on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:53.73,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on. He died, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:56.20,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,That Itadori Yuuji brat, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.93,0:20:59.90,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,Did he, though? I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:09.21,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look inside me without \Npermission. I hate it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:11.05,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:47.49,sign_32727_342_Juju_Stroll,Screen&Voice,0000,0000,0000,,Juju Stroll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:47.49,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:49.22,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,You stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.69,0:22:51.38,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I don't stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:53.23,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,You stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:22:55.94,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I don't stink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:23:00.20,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you treating me like an animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.20,0:23:01.48,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Because you're a panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.73,0:23:02.71,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Mustard leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.71,0:23:04.56,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,You smell like an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.56,0:23:07.26,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,I keep telling you to take \Na bath, and you never do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.46,0:23:09.81,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like getting wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.81,0:23:12.92,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,But unlike you guys, I don't sweat,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:15.26,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,and I Febreze every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.73,0:23:18.30,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,So I don't stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.27,0:23:25.11,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.11,0:23:26.74,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,You guys try taking a whiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.33,0:23:37.94,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't really stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.94,0:23:40.22,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Sort of smells like the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.08,Italics,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.49,0:23:54.95,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(982,1)}Episode 6: \NAfter Rain
